{"id":"campeo_n","lemma":"campeón","pos":"noun","rank":1685,"glosses":["champion, champ (informal address)"],"ipa":"/kampeˈon/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"campeones","feminine":"campeona","femininePlural":"campeonas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e9/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-campe%C3%B3n.wav","examples":[{"text":"Soy campeón de la nación.","en":"I'm the national champion.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/427826"},{"text":"No somos los campeones.","en":"We're not the champions.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/611791"},{"text":"El campeón fue recibido por una enorme multitud.","en":"The champion was welcomed by large crowds.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/635479"},{"text":"Ellos son campeones académicos.","en":"They're academic champions."},{"text":"Sos el campeón, ¿no?","en":"You're the champion, aren't you?"}]}